    "description": "Title\n: Vintage Blue Green Glass Insulators 9pc Lot\nColor\n: Blue Green\nCondition\n: Used\nDepartment\n: Collectibles & Art\nDescription\n: Add a touch of timeless industrial charm to your decor or collection with this 9-piece lot of vintage glass insulators. Featuring a range of beautiful blue and green hues, these insulators showcase classic shapes and varying embossments, capturing the history of utility craftsmanship from an earlier era. Each piece stands uniquely, displaying minor signs of age that add authentic character and story to their look. Made of thick, durable glass, these insulators were once used on telegraph and power poles, making them both visually striking and historically significant. Perfect for collectors, repurposers, or vintage enthusiasts, these insulators can be displayed as vintage decor, incorporated into creative DIY projects, or added to an existing collection. All items in this lot are authentic vintage pieces and are sold as found, offering a piece of history with every insulator. Please review photos for specific condition details on each item.",
